r \uc2 DOUG MEEHAN (WCVB)\par \par \uc2 Old school.\par \par \uc2 TORY JOHNSON (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) So, you could go old school with paper and pen, like you and I like to do, and then we can scan it and reuse it so that we only need this one particular planner. It's made in America, which is very rare for a product that is both tech friendly and ecofriendly. And Keith, you got us a deal. All slashed in half, starts at $17.\par \par \uc2 DOUG MEEHAN (WCVB)\par \par \uc2 All right, all right.\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: MINILUXE HAND CARE\par \par \uc2 TORY JOHNSON (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Okay, one of my favorites, \uc2 Miniluxe\uc2 , they have really revolutionized the whole nailcare industry, starting with clean products, some of my favorites, in fact. So let me give you this. This is the anti-aging hand cream that feels so good.\par \par \uc2 DOUG MEEHAN (WCVB)\par \par \uc2 Oh, my hands look so much younger.\par \par \uc2 TORY JOHNSON (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) There you go. There we go. We've taken 10 years off of your hands. My absolute favorite, this is their cuticle moisturizing oil. I keep this in my purse. You should put that in your pocket. But what I love most is that every one of the products, they're clean, and they support the financial independence of their technicians. And that is really important to the whole culture at \uc2 Miniluxe\uc2 . So, when you buy their products, you're getting something that is Oprah approved, these were an Oprah favorite, and you also know that there's a lot of good that's happening behind the scenes. And Simone has slashed these prices for us, starting at $7.\par \par \uc2 DOUG MEEHAN (WCVB)\par \par \uc2 Fabulous, fabulous.\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: AMELIA ROSE JEWELRY\par \par \uc2 TORY JOHNSON (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) All right, if you watch "GMA," you know Amelia Rose jewelry. If you love Robin's fashion sense, you know Robin wears them all the time. I personally am very happy Amelia chose to ditch her law career to become a jewelry designer. So, we've got the most gorgeous assortment of colorful gems, teardrop and emerald cut, flowers, plus their brand new stretchy bracelets. You know that everyone's been oohing and aahing this morning around these.\par \par \uc2 DOUG MEEHAN (WCVB)\par \par \uc2 So colorful.\par \par \uc2 TORY JOHNSON (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) These are a big favorite at "GMA." And Amelia has slashed the prices for us.\par \par \uc2 DOUG MEEHAN (WCVB)\par \par \uc2 Counselor, thank you.\par \par \uc2 TORY JOHNSON (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) $19 to $39.\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: LOVEPOP CARDS\par \par \uc2 TORY JOHNSON (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Okay, you know this Boston favorite.\par \par \uc2 DOUG MEEHAN (WCVB)\par \par \uc2 Yes, everybody loves it.\par \par \uc2 TORY JOHNSON (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Everybody loves Lovepop. This is really the most genius way to send cards, and it's not just a card. It really is a gift. It wows somebody. Any day is a good day to send a card.\par \par \uc2 DOUG MEEHAN (WCVB)\par \par \uc2 Do you want to be wowed?\par \par \uc2 TORY JOHNSON (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Let's see, let's see. There you go. I'm amazed at every one of these. They're so beautiful. Yesterday you guys went crazy buying Holiball for Christmas decorations. This Pancake the Penguin Christmas adventure, it is not too soon to start stocking up. Lovepop has put together all kinds of assortments for us for birthday, holidays, just any day is a good day to send a card.\par \par \uc2 DOUG MEEHAN (WCVB)\par \par \uc2 Halloween.\par \par \uc2 TORY JOHNSON (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) The Halloween ones. And you guys have slashed prices significantly, starting at $19 for the set.\par \par \uc2 DOUG MEEHAN (WCVB)\par \par \uc2 All right, thank you, thank you.\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: CORAVIN DECANTER\par \par \uc2 TORY JOHNSON (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Okay, pre-\uc2 Coravin\uc2 , pre-\uc2 Coravin\uc2 , we had to drink whatever was open, not necessarily what we wanted.\par \par \uc2 DOUG MEEHAN (WCVB)\par \par \uc2 Didn't want it to go bad.\par \par \uc2 TORY JOHNSON (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) That's right. So, what \uc2 Coravin\uc2  does is allows us to preserve the wine. This pivot allows you up to four weeks. So, if you know you're going to drink the bottle but not necessarily all at once, that's short term preservation. This that Greg is demoing is the long-term preservation. It's the timeless. So, you can pour without ever pulling the cork. So, let's say that you just want to sample some of your finest wine, but then you don't want to drink the whole bottle. You don't have to worry about it going bad. This is another one that is Oprah approved. You guys have slashed the prices in half plus free shipping from \uc2 Coravin\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: EASTERN STANDARD PROVISIONS PRETZELS\par \par \uc2 TORY JOHNSON (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) And then finally here, we've got a wall fan favorite. I want to say it's a "GMA" favorite, America favorite, an Oprah favorite, the most delicious artisanal pretzels from Eastern Standard Provisions. They just taste great. Heat and eat. They come already prepared for you. You'll have these, you keep them in the freezer so that if guests come over and you pop this in the oven, you look like...\par \par \uc2 DOUG MEEHAN (WCVB)\par \par \uc2 A rock star.\par \par \uc2 TORY JOHNSON (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) A complete rock star. These are, show us the deal, $20. And then Doug, we've got teachers here from Breen Middle School. School starts just in a couple of weeks. It was important to you that we say thank you to them and to wish them a good year. So, Jimmy. Where's Jimmy? Every one of these businesses has brought a gift that our teachers are going to go home with.\par \par \uc2 DOUG MEEHAN (WCVB)\par \par \uc2 We love our teachers. Enjoy.\par \par \uc2 TORY JOHNSON (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) There you go.\par \par \uc2 REBECCA JARVIS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Oh, yes, Tory and Doug we do love our teachers, and I love these pretzels. They're excellent. We have partnered with these companies on these deals, and you can get them on our website at goodmorningamerica.com. We'll be right back.\par \par \uc2 COMMERCIAL BREAK\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: STORY SYNOPSIS\par \par \uc2 COMMERCIAL BREAK\par \par \uc2 Document GMA0000020230818ej880000p\par }\page {\par\fs20\b \uc2 WEATHER\b0\par\par\uc2 576 \uc2 words\par \uc2 8 August 2023\par \uc2 ABC News: Good Morning America\par \uc2 GMA\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2023, American Broadcasting Companies, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 STORMS, TORNADOES\par \par \uc2 STORM, FLIGHTS, TRAVEL\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: SEVERE WEATHER CAUSES AIR TRAVEL CHAOS\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: MORE THAN 10,000 FLIGHTS CANCELED OR DELAYED\par \par \uc2 WEATHER, TRACK, STORM, HEAT\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: NEW SEVERE WEATHER THREAT\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: MIDWEST AT RISK FOR LARGE HAIL & POSSIBLE TORNADOES\par \par \uc2 WALKOUT, STRIKE, LOS ANGELES\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: LOS ANGELES CITY WORKERS SET TO STRIKE\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: ONE-DAY WALKOUT OVER WHAT UNION CALLS UNFAIR LABOR PRACTICES\par \par \uc2 RUSSIA, WAR, UKRAINE, ASSASSINATION\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: DEADLY STRIKE ON RESIDENTIAL AREA\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: AT LEAST EIGHT KILLED, DOZENS INJURED IN RUSSIAN MISSILE ATTACK\par \par \uc2 TRUMP, ELECTION INTERFERENCE, EVIDENCE\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: TRUMP CHALLENGES EVIDENCE LIMITS IN ELECTION CASE\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: FORMER PRESIDENT'S LEGAL TEAM SEEKS NARROWER PROTECTIVE ORDER\par \par \uc2 OHIO, ELECTION, ABORTION RIGHTS\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: HIGH-STAKES OHIO SPECIAL ELECTION\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: PROPOSAL COULD IMPACT ABORTION ACCESS\par \par \uc2 SHIVER, BAIL\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: ALLEGED BAHAMAS MURDER-FOR-HIRE PLOT\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: GEORGIA MOM ACCUSED OF CONSPIRING TO KILL HUSBAND SET TO BE RELEASED ON BAIL\par \par \