HICS: SANDRA BULLOCK'S HEARTBREAK\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: PARTNER BRYAN RANDALL DIES AFTER PRIVATE THREE-YEAR BATTLE WITH ALS\par \par \uc2 CAR, CRASH, HERRERA, ROHRBACH, \uc2 FEDEX\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: HERO DELIVERY DRIVER REUNITED WITH MAN HE SAVED\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: FEDEX WORKER PULLED MAN FROM WRECKAGE OF BURNING CAR\par \par \uc2 STORMS, EAST COAST, DEATH, DESTRUCTION\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: SEVERE SUMMER STORMS TURN DEADLY\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: AT LEAST TWO KILLED AS WEATHER SLAMS EAST COAST\par \par \uc2 OHIO, ELECTION, CONSTITUTION, AMENDMENT, ABORTION\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: HIGH-STAKES OHIO SPECIAL ELECTION\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: PROPOSAL COULD IMPACT ABORTION ACCESS\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Now to Ohio, where voters are facing a decision that could determine the fate of abortion rights in the state and have a political impact heading into the 2024 presidential election. Stephanie Ramos is back and tracking that for us. Good morning again, Stephanie.\par \par \uc2 STEPHANIE RAMOS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Hey there, Robin. Today's question on the ballot in Ohio is whether or not to raise the standards to pass a constitutional amendment. Ohio is the only state with abortion access on the ballot this year. The measure is largely seen as an abortion fight. If the threshold is raised, it would make an amendment set to appear on the November ballot that would make abortion protections into the constitution more difficult to pass. And early voter turnout in Ohio has surged for today's special election. More than 500,000 people have already voted. Guys.\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) That says something right there, Stephanie, thank you, appreciate it. Coming up in our "GMA Morning Menu," do you use the cash app Zelle? Well, if you do, got a notice, there's a new warning about a scam where you get a text, and it really appears that it's from your bank, but it's not.\par \par \uc2 GEORGE STEPHANOPOULOS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) That is something also. Ginger's in Arizona to introduce us to a robot named Andi that could help save lives when it comes to extreme heat.\par \par \uc2 REBECCA JARVIS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Plus, we're going to flip it and reverse it and celebrate the trailblazing women of hip-hop, and it is National Pickleball Day. Lori Bergamotto is in Central Park. Hey, Lori.\par \par \uc2 LORI BERGAMOTTO (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 Hey, Rebecca, that's right. Happy National Pickleball Day. We've got all the essentials you need to celebrate by playing at home or in the studio like our crew there with this top selling Rally Meister kit. It includes four paddles, four balls, a net, a rules guide. You can shop that item by scanning the QR code on your screen. We've got more pickleball fun, coming up...\par \par \uc2 COMMERCIAL BREAK\par \par \uc2 ANNOUNCER\par \par \uc2 Next Wednesday...\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 When you say you're going to get married on "Good Morning America," I haven't said it...\par \par \uc2 REPORTER (FEMALE)\par \par \uc2 Say it out loud.\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 Okay, I'm saying yes to marriage. You better set a date.\par \par \uc2 ANNOUNCER\par \par \uc2 You're invited to one joyous bachelorette party. Celebrate Robin and her fianc\u233\'00\'E9e, Amber, right before they say I do, from having first met to right now.\par \par \uc2 AMBER LAIGN (ROBIN'S FIANCEE)\par \par \uc2 Hi. The rest is history.\par \par \uc2 ANNOUNCER\par \par \uc2 Feel the love, and, oh yeah, party.\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 Yeah, let's do this.\par \par \uc2 ANNOUNCER\par \par \uc2 Next Wednesday, only on "GMA."\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 All right, go ahead.\par \par \uc2 REBECCA JARVIS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 Oh, welcome back. Our dear Robin Roberts is getting married to sweet Amber. We cannot wait to celebrate. And you've got a bachelorette party, which is that...?\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 That's more nerve-wracking than the wedding and the marriage.\par \par \uc2 GEORGE STEPHANOPOULOS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 I had not thought of this until I saw that promo just now. Could 14-year-old Robin Roberts have imagined she would be having a bachelorette party on national television?\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 No, especially to a woman.\par \par \uc2 REBECCA JARVIS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 Well, we cannot wait to raise a glass and celebrate you. It's going to be one for the books, absolutely.\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 Thank you, appreciate that. Let's move along. Let's move along.\par \par \uc2 GEORGE STEPHANOPOULOS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 Radical honesty on "GMA." That's a good thing.\par \par \uc2 REBECCA JARVIS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 We love that, and it's coming up on Wednesday, the bachelorette party. So, be there, and you're all invited.\par \par \uc2 Document GMA0000020230818ej880000l\par }\page {\par\fs20\b \uc2 BRIAN KELLEY PERFORMS LIVE "SEE YA NEXT SUMMER"\b0\par\par\uc2 541 \uc2 words\par \uc2 8 August 2023\par \uc2 ABC News: Good Morning America\par \uc2 GMA\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2023, American Broadcasting Companies, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 STORMS, TORNADOES\par \par \uc2 STORM, FLIGHTS, TRAVEL\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: SEVERE WEATHER CAUSES AIR TRAVEL CHAOS\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: MORE THAN 10,000 FLIGHTS CANCELED OR DELAYED\par \par \uc2 WEATHER, TRACK, STORM, HEAT\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: NEW SEVERE WEATHER THREAT\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: MIDWEST AT RISK FOR LARGE HAIL & POSSIBLE TORNADOES\par \par \uc2 WALKOUT, STRIKE, LOS ANGELES\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: LOS ANGELES CITY WORKERS SET TO STRIKE\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: ONE-DAY WALKOUT OVER WHAT UNION CALLS UNFAIR LABOR PRACTICES\par \par \uc2 RUSSIA, WAR, UKRAINE, ASSASSINATION\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: DEADLY