watching. Have a great day, everyone.\par \par \uc2 Document GMA0000020230818ej880000v\par }\page {\par\fs20\b \uc2 CELEBRATING NATIONAL PICKLEBALL DAY EXPLORING NEW SPORTS TREND\b0\par\par\uc2 1,243 \uc2 words\par \uc2 8 August 2023\par \uc2 ABC News: Good Morning America\par \uc2 GMA\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2023, American Broadcasting Companies, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 STORMS, TORNADOES\par \par \uc2 STORM, FLIGHTS, TRAVEL\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: SEVERE WEATHER CAUSES AIR TRAVEL CHAOS\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: MORE THAN 10,000 FLIGHTS CANCELED OR DELAYED\par \par \uc2 WEATHER, TRACK, STORM, HEAT\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: NEW SEVERE WEATHER THREAT\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: MIDWEST AT RISK FOR LARGE HAIL & POSSIBLE TORNADOES\par \par \uc2 WALKOUT, STRIKE, LOS ANGELES\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: LOS ANGELES CITY WORKERS SET TO STRIKE\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: ONE-DAY WALKOUT OVER WHAT UNION CALLS UNFAIR LABOR PRACTICES\par \par \uc2 RUSSIA, WAR, UKRAINE, ASSASSINATION\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: DEADLY STRIKE ON RESIDENTIAL AREA\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: AT LEAST EIGHT KILLED, DOZENS INJURED IN RUSSIAN MISSILE ATTACK\par \par \uc2 TRUMP, ELECTION INTERFERENCE, EVIDENCE\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: TRUMP CHALLENGES EVIDENCE LIMITS IN ELECTION CASE\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: FORMER PRESIDENT'S LEGAL TEAM SEEKS NARROWER PROTECTIVE ORDER\par \par \uc2 OHIO, ELECTION, ABORTION RIGHTS\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: HIGH-STAKES OHIO SPECIAL ELECTION\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: PROPOSAL COULD IMPACT ABORTION ACCESS\par \par \uc2 SHIVER, BAIL\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: ALLEGED BAHAMAS MURDER-FOR-HIRE PLOT\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: GEORGIA MOM ACCUSED OF CONSPIRING TO KILL HUSBAND SET TO BE RELEASED ON BAIL\par \par \uc2 BIDEN, NATIONAL MONUMENT, TRIBAL, MINING\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: PRESIDENT BIDEN DECLARES NEW NATIONAL MONUMENT\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: PROTECTING TRIBAL LAND NEAR GRAND CANYON FROM URANIUM MINING\par \par \uc2 SHARK, ATTACK, STEIDLE\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: W