the race for the White House. Jon, thank you.\par \par \uc2 Document WNT0000020230518ej5e00007\par }\page {\par\fs20\b \uc2 FDA\uc2  APPROVES DRUG FOR HOT FLASHES ONCE-A-DAY PILL TO HELP TREAT SEVERITY DURING MENOPAUSE\b0\par\par\uc2 529 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 May 2023\par \uc2 ABC News: Good Morning America\par \uc2 GMA\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2023, American Broadcasting Companies, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: GOOD MORNING AMERICA\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: CITIES BRACE FOR EXPECTED MIGRANT SURGE: EYES ON THE BORDER\par \par \uc2 TITLE 42, IMMIGRATION, BORDER, DHS, RANGEL-SAMPONARO, NUNEZ-NETO, JEAN-PIERRE\par \par \uc2 NEW YORK, CHICAGO, DC, MIGRANTS, BUS\par \par \uc2 TORNADOES, OUTBREAK, MIDWEST\par \par \uc2 PENNY, MARINE, CHOKEHOLD, MANSLAUGHTER, NEELY, MILLS, HIGGINS\par \par \uc2 UKRAINE, RUSSIA, WAR, BAKHMUT, LUTE\par \par \uc2 DEBT CEILING, DEFAULTING\par \par \uc2 TRUMP, DESANTIS, 2024, RACE, IOWA\par \par \uc2 FOXX, CORINNE, JAMIE, HEALTH, HOSPITAL\par \par \uc2 NBA\uc2 , JAMES, LAKERS, WARRIORS\par \par \uc2 MOVIE CLIP: "MEAN GIRLS"\par \par \uc2 VALLOW-DAYBELL, MURDER, CHILDREN, CONVICTED, GUILTY\par \par \uc2 CARTER, FAMILY, REMAINS, AUTOPSY\par \par \uc2 BRADY, FOOTBALL, RAIDERS, WICKERSHAM\par \par \uc2 FAN, COSTS, CONCERTS, BEYONCE, TAYLOR, OVERSEAS, CHOU, MERCER, MUSE\par \par \uc2 PILGRIM\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: GMA PLAY OF THE DAY\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: GOOD MORNING AMERICA\par \par \uc2 TITLE 42, IMMIGRATION, CRISIS\par \par \uc2 VEOZAH, HOT FLASHES, MENOPAUSE, \uc2 FDA\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: \uc2 FDA\uc2  APPROVES DRUG FOR HOT FLASHES\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: ONCE-A-DAY PILL TO HELP TREAT SEVERITY DURING MENOPAUSE\par \par \uc2 JANAI NORMAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Now for the breakthrough drug for hot flashes. The \uc2 FDA\uc2  approving treatment that will be a big relief to millions of women. Here with the details is ABC's Em Nguyen. Em, good morning to you.\par \par \uc2 EM NGUYEN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Good morning, Janai. This \uc2 FDA\uc2 -approved first-of-its-kind drug can treat moderate to severe hot flashes caused by menopause.\par \par \uc2 EM NGUYEN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) Drugmaker Astellas says the pill called fezolinetant branded as Veozah is hormone free, offering relief to millions of women who cannot or don not want to take hormone therapy because of other underlying concerns, such as a history of strokes, heart attacks or blood clots. This treatment targets the brain's temperature control center to decrease both the frequency and intensity of hot flashes in women. And researches found fezolinetant decreased hot flashes by more than 50% in most women studied. The most common side effect was headache followed by other issues like insomnia, back pain and abdominal pain.\par \par \uc2 EM NGUYEN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) And medical experts warn anyone with severe liver and kidney damage should not take the drug. Now, hot flashes occur in around 80% of menopausal women usually between the ages of 45 and 55. And, Janai, one OBGYN telling ABC News she believes this newly approved drug could be revolutionary in the menopause landscape. The once-a-day Veozah is expected to be available in pharmacies within three weeks. Guys?\par \par \uc2 JANAI NORMAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) This will be welcome news for millions of women across the country. Thank you, Em.\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: GMA MORNING MENU\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: IN 3 MINUTES, ALLERGY SEASON CHECK-IN\par \par \uc2 JANAI NORMAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) And still coming up on our "GMA Morning Menu," allergies wreaking havoc across the country. You're probably impacted. What you need to know to stay healthy.\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: IN 6 MINUTES, CELEBRATING MOTHER'S DAY\par \par \uc2 WHIT JOHNSON (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) Also ahead, "GMA" celebrating Mother's Day weekend, introducing you to the military mom making a difference in her community.\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: IN 12 MINUTES, DOUBLE THE STEALS!\par \par \uc2 EVA PILGRIM (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) Plus, double the deals and twice the steals. Tory is in the house with a dozen deals you won't want to miss. We'll be right back.\par \par \uc2 COMMERCIAL BREAK\par \par \uc2 Document GMA0000020230613ej5d0003d\par }\par \b \uc2 Search Summary\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9360\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9360\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9360\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Date\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 01/01/2021 to 06/30/2026\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9360\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9360\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Source\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\